ield-2}} | $-2$ |  |  |  |\n|  | {{field-3}} | $3$ |  |  |  |\n|  | $7$ |  |  |  |  |\n|  | $-1$ |  |  |  |  |" :question/worked-solution "First, we reorganize the equations so that they are in the right order, to get\n\n$$\n{\\begin{aligned}3x+2y=7 \\\\ x+2y=-1.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nNow, we can represent this system of equations in the form $Ax=b:$\n\n$$\n[\\begin{aligned}3 & 2 \\\\ 1 & 2\\end{aligned}][\\begin{aligned}x \\\\ y\\end{aligned}]=[\\begin{aligned}7 \\\\ -1\\end{aligned}]\n$$\n\nTo find the solution, we need to calculate the inverse of the coefficient matrix \n$A=[\\begin{aligned}3 & 2 \\\\ 1 & 2\\end{aligned}].$\nThis gives\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{A}^{-1} & =\\frac{1}{3\\cdot 2-1\\cdot 2}[\\begin{aligned}2 & -2 \\\\ -1 & 3\\end{aligned}] \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{4}[\\begin{aligned}2 & -2 \\\\ -1 & 3\\end{aligned}].\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nWe can now represent the solution to this system as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}x & ={A}^{-1}b \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{4}[\\begin{aligned}2 & -2 \\\\ -1 & 3\\end{aligned}][\\begin{aligned}7 \\\\ -1\\end{aligned}]\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/hard :question/answer-fields ["q-320811/field-1" "q-320811/field-2" "q-320811/field-3"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "4691976a-d825-5f6c-aed7-0d9b45560952"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-320811"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-321437/field-1/3a3e10526f40c673b7703a3c103fe7589223997acb2a083d0e3a20b742c55555" :answer/id #uuid "a9c56f5d-7762-5b58-b737-79569dab6418" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{1}{8}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-321437/field-1/aa640bdf1bd5b2b15c3dbfe770f68b41d304d610e4d1af786c1f1372fe3dc48f" :answer/id #uuid "6c0e98c3-a01e-55dd-9754-51a1c7cca239" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "-\\frac{1}{8}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-321437/field-1" :answer-field/id #uuid "e6804b31-8acd-5d8b-93f3-0cee9e33c91d" :answer-field/key "field-1"